### PG approved callback
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payments/callbacks/pg
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "transactionId": "pg-1",
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "failureReason": null,
  "signature": "replace-with-hmac-signature"
}

### PG failed callback
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payments/callbacks/pg
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "transactionId": null,
  "status": "FAILED",
  "failureReason": "카드 승인에 실패했습니다.",
  "signature": "replace-with-hmac-signature"
}
